Z||000000||BAM-BAM||04-30-2000||02:02 PM||||     How hard is it to install a rear window with a defroster in a car that doesn't have one? I have  an 85GT with no defroster option, can this be done relatively easy? I have access to one and the switch bezel, is the harness pre installed in the car or do I need the harness? TIA for any help.<P> Thanx, BAM-BAM  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||5
Z||000001||batboy||04-30-2000||03:43 PM||||Unless you live in an area that gets a lot of ice, I won't worry about it. The heat coming up from the louvers does as good as job on my 85 GT as the rear defroster on my 87 SE.||||reg||1
Z||000002||BAM-BAM||04-30-2000||03:50 PM||||  BB, I was thinking of it more as a novelty rather than a neccessity. Just a  little something extra. If it's a big hassle I'll forget it, if not then "I want it" <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. Thanks for your input. However, do you know about the difficulties? Is it a biotch or what?.<P> Thanx, BAM OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
Z||000003||stimpy||04-30-2000||04:21 PM||||In Las Vegas? A defroster?  Tell ya what, get a straight-edgd, some rust colored model paint and paint on that sucker! Gotta be a lot easier to install and just as useful!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000004||fierosound||04-30-2000||06:08 PM||||From what the auto glass shops have told me while getting my windshield replaced - they DO NOT replace the rear windows.  They send them to a GM dealer's body shop.  Apparently, there is ALOT of dismantling required back there, in order to get one replaced.  How much trouble it really is, I don't know - just thought I'd pass it along.||||reg||10
Z||000005||BOILERMAKER||04-30-2000||09:05 PM||||Did it!  Won't ever do that again.  It's a royal pain in the bum.  Lots to take off so that the window comes right out (at least the way we did it) and the knife method used to cut the black goop in order not to break the original glass was very time consuming.<P>I won't ever do that again.||||reg||1
